      "text": "I had GPT-6 Pro re-analyze the fun finding that violent video games reduce crime, as people stay home playing them. It downloaded fresh crime data and extended prior work.\n\nYes, GTA V's 2013 launch was linked with a dip in violence internationally. Other Rockstar games are more ambiguous, though.",
